              <div class=\"tags\">\n   582→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI applications</span>\n   583→                        <span class=\"tag\">finance</span>\n   584→                        <span class=\"tag\">research</span>\n   585→                    </div>\n   586→                </div>\n   587→\n   588→                <div class=\"item\">\n   589→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   590→                        <span class=\"source-indicator source-hn\">HN</span>\n   591→                        <a href=\"https://seed.bytedance.com/en/blog/one-take-creation-flexible-referencing-introducing-seedance-2-5\">Seedance 2.5: Bytedance AI Video Tool</a>\n   592→                    </div>\n   593→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   594→                        Bytedance releases updated AI video creation tool with flexible referencing capabilities for content creation.\n   595→                    </div>\n   596→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">Bytedance | 2026-08-02</div>\n   597→                    <div class=\"tags\">\n   598→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI video</span>\n   599→                        <span class=\"tag\">content creation</span>\n   600→                    </div>\n   601→                </div>\n   602→\n   603→                <div class=\"item\">\n   604→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   605→                        <span class=\"source-indicator source-hn\">HN</span>\n   606→                        <a href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/usage-page-to-token-amount-what/167153\">Cursor Pricing Transparency Controversy</a>\n   607→                    </div>\n   608→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   609→                        AI coding tool Cursor faces user backlash after removing pricing transparency features. 129+ comments expressing community concern.\n   610→                    </div>\n   611→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">Cursor forum | 2026-08-02</div>\n   612→                    <div class=\"tags\">\n   613→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding tools</span>\n   614→                        <span class=\"tag\">pricing</span>\n   615→                        <span class=\"tag\">transparency</span>\n   616→                    </div>\n   617→                </div>\n   618→\n   619→                <div class=\"item\">\n   620→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   621→                        <span class=\"source-indicator source-blog\">BLOG</span>\n   622→                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/1/greg-brockman/\">Greg Brockman on AI Relationships</a>\n   623→                    </div>\n   624→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   625→                        OpenAI President notes people object to coworker's ChatGPT contacting them for help. Humans value direct relationships and find AI-mediated communication inappropriate in certain contexts.\n   626→                    </div>\n   627→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">Simon Willison | 2026-08-01</div>\n   628→                    <div class=\"tags\">\n   629→                        <span class=\"tag\">HCI</span>\n   630→                        <span class=\"tag\">social dynamics</span>\n   631→                        <span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n   632→                    </div>\n   633→                </div>\n   634→\n   635→                <div class=\"item\">\n   636→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   637→                        <span class=\"source-indicator source-blog\">BLOG</span>\n   638→                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/1/datasette-apps/\">datasette-apps 0.2a0 with Invisible Agent Testing</a>\n   639→                    </div>\n   640→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   641→                        New debugging tools allowing Datasette Agent to invisibly test apps via